<section class="section mission-section" id="planejar"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">07 / ORGANIZE SUA IDEIA</p><h2>Mission<br><em>Control.</em></h2><p>Monte um resumo inicial. O configurador não salva nem envia seus dados.</p></div><div class="mission-card"><div class="mission-progress"><span id="mission-step-label">ETAPA 01 / 03</span><div><i id="mission-progress-bar"></i></div></div><form id="mission-form"><fieldset data-step="0"><legend>Que tipo de solução você imagina?</legend><div class="choice-grid"><?php foreach($c['solutions'] as $i=>$s): ?><label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="solution" value="<?=e($s)?>" <?=$i===0?'required':''?>><span><?=e($s)?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></fieldset><fieldset data-step="1" hidden><legend>O que seria útil no projeto?</legend><div class="choice-grid"><?php foreach($c['features'] as $s): ?><label class="choice"><input type="checkbox" name="features[]" value="<?=e($s)?>"><span><?=e($s)?></span></label><?php endforeach; ?></div></fieldset><fieldset data-step="2" hidden><legend>Mais algum contexto? <small>(opcional)</small></legend><label class="wide-label">Resumo breve<textarea name="notes" rows="4" maxlength="600" placeholder="Conte um pouco sobre seu objetivo."></textarea></label><p class="small-note">Até 600 caracteres. O conteúdo fica somente nesta página.</p></fieldset><div class="mission-actions"><button type="button" id="mission-back" class="button button-quiet" disabled>Voltar</button><button type="button" id="mission-next" class="button button-primary">Continuar ↗</button><button type="submit" id="mission-summary" class="button button-primary" hidden>Preparar resumo</button></div></form><div class="mission-result" id="mission-result" hidden aria-live="polite"><h3>Resumo da ideia</h3><pre id="mission-text"></pre><button id="mission-copy" class="button button-secondary">Copiar resumo</button><button id="mission-reset" class="text-link">Começar de novo</button></div></div></section>
